{"page":512,"verses":[{"verse_key":"48:10","surah":48,"ayah":10,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يُبَايِعُونَكَ إِنَّمَا يُبَايِعُونَ ٱللَّهَ يَدُ ٱللَّهِ فَوْقَ أَيْدِيهِمْ ۚ فَمَن نَّكَثَ فَإِنَّمَا يَنكُثُ عَلَىٰ نَفْسِهِۦ ۖ وَمَنْ أَوْفَىٰ بِمَا عَـٰهَدَ عَلَيْهُ ٱللَّهَ فَسَيُؤْتِيهِ أَجْرًا عَظِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who pledge loyalty to you [Prophet] are actually pledging loyalty to God Himself- God’s hand is placed on theirs––and anyone who breaks his pledge does so to his own detriment: God will give a great reward to the one who fulfils his pledge to Him.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُبَايِعُونَكَ","en_gloss":"pledge allegiance to you","transliteration":"yubāyiʿūnaka","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"only","transliteration":"innamā","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يُبَايِعُونَ","en_gloss":"they pledge allegiance","transliteration":"yubāyiʿūna","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(to) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَدُ","en_gloss":"(The) Hand","transliteration":"yadu","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَوْقَ","en_gloss":"(is) over","transliteration":"fawqa","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَيْدِيهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"their hands","transliteration":"aydīhim","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"Then whoever","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَّكَثَ","en_gloss":"breaks (his oath)","transliteration":"nakatha","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَإِنَّمَا","en_gloss":"then only","transliteration":"fa-innamā","verse_key":"48:10"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَنكُثُ","en_gloss":"he breaks","transliteration":"yankuthu","verse_key":"48:10"},{