"verse_key":"48:12"}]},{"verse_key":"48:13","surah":48,"ayah":13,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَن لَّمْ يُؤْمِنۢ بِٱللَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ فَإِنَّآ أَعْتَدْنَا لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ سَعِيرًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We have prepared a blazing Fire for those who do not believe in God and His Messenger.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَّمْ","en_gloss":"(has) not believed","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يُؤْمِنۢ","en_gloss":"(has) not believed","transliteration":"yu'min","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":4,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlihi","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَإِنَّآ","en_gloss":"then indeed, We","transliteration":"fa-innā","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَعْتَدْنَا","en_gloss":"[We] have prepared","transliteration":"aʿtadnā","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"for the disbelievers","transliteration":"lil'kāfirīna","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":9,"ar":"سَعِيرًۭا","en_gloss":"a Blazing Fire","transliteration":"saʿīran","verse_key":"48:13"},{"pos":10,"ar":"١٣","en_gloss":"(13)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"48:13"}]},{"verse_key":"48:14","surah":48,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ مُلْكُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ يَغْفِرُ لِمَن يَشَآءُ وَيُعَذِّبُ مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَكَانَ ٱللَّهُ غَفُورًا رَّحِيمًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Control of the heavens and earth belongs to God and He forgives whoever He will and punishes whoever He will: God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"And for Allah","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مُلْكُ","en_gloss":"(is the) kingdom","transliteration":"mul'ku","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"(of) the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَغْفِرُ","en_gloss":"He forgives","transliteration":"yaghfiru","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِمَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"liman","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَيُعَذِّبُ","en_gloss":"and punishes","transliteration":"wayuʿadhibu","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَكَانَ","en_gloss":"And is","transliteration":"wakāna","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":13,"ar":"غَفُورًۭا","en_gloss":"Oft-Forgiving","transliteration":"ghafūran","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رَّحِيمًۭا","en_gloss":"Most Merciful","transliteration":"raḥīman","verse_key":"48:14"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"48:14"}]},{"verse_key":"48:15","surah":48,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"سَيَقُولُ ٱلْمُخَلَّفُونَ إِذَا ٱنطَلَقْتُمْ إِلَىٰ مَغَانِمَ لِتَأْخُذُوهَا ذَرُونَا نَتَّبِعْكُمْ ۖ يُرِيدُونَ أَن يُبَدِّلُوا۟ كَلَـٰمَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ قُل لَّن تَتَّبِعُونَا كَذَٰلِكُمْ قَالَ ٱللَّهُ مِن قَبْلُ ۖ فَسَيَقُولُونَ بَلْ تَحْسُدُونَنَا ۚ بَلْ كَانُوا۟ لَا يَفْقَهُونَ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"When you [believers] set off for somewhere that promises war gains, those who [previously] stayed behind will say, ‘Let us come with you.’ They want to change God’s words, but tell them [Prophet], ‘You may not come with us: God has said this before.’ They will reply, ‘You begrudge us out of jealousy.’ How little they understand!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سَيَقُولُ","en_gloss":"Will say","transliteration":"sayaqūlu","verse_key":"48:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":